One-Block Reborn

One-Block Reborn is a One Block survival game mode for Minecraft 1.21.1. Each player gets their own island and independent progression through 10 different stages.

Features

* A separate One Block island for every player.
* Independent progression for each island.
* 10 unique stages, from The Plains to The End.
* Friends can visit your island and help break your One Block.
* Customizable blocks with individual spawn percentages.
* Customizable mobs with an overall mob spawn chance and individual mob percentages.
* Customizable chests and loot with configurable percentages and item quantities.
* Blocks that players can completely fall through are automatically excluded.
* The One Block automatically restores itself if it is destroyed by an explosion or another non-player event.
* Stage transition notifications show the new stage and the player who broke the final required block.
* An in-game configuration GUI for managing the entire One Block system.
* Russian and English language support.
* Commands for managing player progress and configuration.

Stages

The mod includes 10 default stages:

1. The Plains
2. The Underground
3. Icy Tundra
4. Ocean
5. Jungle Dungeon
6. Red Desert
7. The Nether
8. Idyll
9. Desolate Land
10. The End

Every stage can be enabled, disabled, renamed, and customized.

Configuration

The in-game configuration GUI allows you to customize island settings, stages, blocks, mobs, chests, and loot.

All percentage values use a 0–100% range. For example, entering 10 means 10%.

The configuration can be changed without restarting the server.

Commands

OP level 2 or higher can use:

/oneblockreborn reload
/oneblockreborn resetconfig
/oneblockreborn info <player>
/oneblockreborn stage <player> <stage>
/oneblockreborn reset <player>

Requirements

* Minecraft Java Edition 1.21.1
* NeoForge 21.1.213 or compatible 21.1.x version
